## Command

```shell
biome check --use-editorconfig=true tabs.js foo/spaces.js
```

## `.editorconfig`

```editorconfig

[*]
indent_style = tab

[foo/**]
indent_style = space

```

## `tabs.js`

```js

    if (foo) {
        console.log("this should be indented with spaces");
    }
    
```

